---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title='预约加入 · Join the Circle · wo/men in tech'
  description='预约交流与加入 wo/men in tech 社群。低压力、真诚、互相托举。'
  width='reading'
>
  <div class='page-container'>
    <header class='page-header'>
      <span class='section-eyebrow'>JOIN THE CIRCLE</span>

      <div class='lang-zh'>
        <h1 class='page-title'>预约交流 · 加入“我们”</h1>
        <p class='page-lead'>
          如果你在技术、设计或创造领域，正在寻找同频且能互相托举的伙伴，<br />
          欢迎留下你的声音。没有复杂的考核，只有平等的倾听与共同打磨。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class='lang-en'>
        <h1 class='page-title'>Join the Circle · Reserve Seat</h1>
        <p class='page-lead'>
          If you are creating across technology, design, or writing, seeking quiet companions to mutually uplift,<br />
          you are warmly invited to leave a note. No tests, only equal listening and deliberate craft.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class='gold-hairline'></div>
    </header>

    <div class='form-card-container'>
      <form id='circle-join-form' class='quiet-form'>
        {/* 字段 1: 称呼 */}
        <div class='form-field'>
          <label class='field-label' for='join-name'>
            <span class='lang-zh'>如何称呼你</span>
            <span class='lang-en'>What should we call you</span>
            <span class='field-hint lang-zh'>名字或习惯的称呼</span>
            <span class='field-hint lang-en'>Name or preferred moniker</span>
          </label>
          <input
            type='text'
            id='join-name'
            name='name'
            placeholder='例如：Erin 或你习惯的称呼'
            data-placeholder-zh='例如：Erin 或你习惯的称呼'
            data-placeholder-en='e.g., Erin or your preferred moniker'
            required
            autocomplete='off'
          />
        </div>

        {/* 字段 2: 从事领域 (前置细金线单选列表) */}
        <div class='form-field'>
          <label class='field-label'>
            <span class='lang-zh'>你在从事的领域</span>
            <span class='lang-en'>Your Primary Craft</span>
            <span class='field-hint lang-zh'>单选 · 用于安排同频交流</span>
            <span class='field-hint lang-en'>Single choice</span>
          </label>
          <div class='quiet-check-list' role='radiogroup' aria-label='从事领域'>
            <label class='quiet-check-row is-radio'>
              <input type='radio' name='craft' value='design' checked />
              <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'></span>
              <div class='check-content'>
                <span class='check-title lang-zh'>设计 · 视觉传达 / 交互体验 (IxD / UI)</span>
                <span class='check-title lang-en'>Design · Interaction & Visual Craft (IxD / UI)</span>
                <span class='check-note lang-zh'>视觉、触感与动效</span>
                <span class='check-note lang-en'>Visuals, typography & micro-interactions</span>
              </div>
            </label>

            <label class='quiet-check-row is-radio'>
              <input type='radio' name='craft' value='product' />
              <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'></span>
              <div class='check-content'>
                <span class='check-title lang-zh'>产品 · 商业逻辑 / 独立孵化 (PM)</span>
                <span class='check-title lang-en'>Product · Product Strategy & Independent Projects (PM)</span>
                <span class='check-note lang-zh'>痛点挖掘与体验闭环</span>
                <span class='check-note lang-en'>Problem framing & human experience loops</span>
              </div>
            </label>

            <label class='quiet-check-row is-radio'>
              <input type='radio' name='craft' value='engineering' />
              <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'></span>
              <div class='check-content'>
                <span class='check-title lang-zh'>工程 · 前端架构 / 独立全栈 (FE / Fullstack)</span>
                <span class='check-title lang-en'>Engineering · Frontend Architecture & Systems (FE)</span>
                <span class='check-note lang-zh'>代码实现与鲁棒工程</span>
                <span class='check-note lang-en'>Robust code craftsmanship and system design</span>
              </div>
            </label>

            <label class='quiet-check-row is-radio'>
              <input type='radio' name='craft' value='research' />
              <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'></span>
              <div class='check-content'>
                <span class='check-title lang-zh'>研究 · 用户洞察 / 写作出版 (Research / Writing)</span>
                <span class='check-title lang-en'>Research · User Inquiries & Writing (Research / Writing)</span>
                <span class='check-note lang-zh'>深度观察与概念叙事</span>
                <span class='check-note lang-en'>Deep cultural observation and conceptual synthesis</span>
              </div>
            </label>

            <label class='quiet-check-row is-radio'>
              <input type='radio' name='craft' value='other' />
              <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'></span>
              <div class='check-content'>
                <span class='check-title lang-zh'>其他创造性领域 · 自由探索者</span>
                <span class='check-title lang-en'>Other Creative Pursuits · Independent Explorers</span>
                <span class='check-note lang-zh'>跨学科独立创作者</span>
                <span class='check-note lang-en'>Cross-disciplinary creators and tinkerers</span>
              </div>
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* 字段 3: 感兴趣的活动 (前置细金线多选列表) */}
        <div class='form-field'>
          <label class='field-label'>
            <span class='lang-zh'>想参与的活动形式</span>
            <span class='lang-en'>Gatherings of Interest</span>
            <span class='field-hint lang-zh'>多选 · 可全选</span>
            <span class='field-hint lang-en'>Multiple choice</span>
          </label>
          <div class='quiet-check-list'>
            <label class='quiet-check-row'>
              <input type='checkbox' name='interests' value='coffee_chat' checked />
              <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'>
                <svg viewBox='0 0 12 12' fill='none'><path d='M2.5 6L5 8.5L9.5 3.5'/></svg>
              </span>
              <div class='check-content'>
                <span class='check-title lang-zh'>Coffee Chat</span>
                <span class='check-title lang-en'>Coffee Chat</span>
                <span class='check-note lang-zh'>双周轻聚 · 低压真诚</span>
                <span class='check-note lang-en'>Biweekly · low pressure, genuine connection</span>
              </div>
            </label>

            <label class='quiet-check-row'>
              <input type='checkbox' name='interests' value='english_chat' checked />
              <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'>
                <svg viewBox='0 0 12 12' fill='none'><path d='M2.5 6L5 8.5L9.5 3.5'/></svg>
              </span>
              <div class='check-content'>
                <span class='check-title lang-zh'>English Tech & Design Chat</span>
                <span class='check-title lang-en'>English Tech & Design Chat</span>
                <span class='check-note lang-zh'>跨文化表达 · 5 min Show & Tell</span>
                <span class='check-note lang-en'>Biweekly online · 5 min Show & Tell</span>
              </div>
            </label>

            <label class='quiet-check-row'>
              <input type='checkbox' name='interests' value='portfolio_building' checked />
              <span class='check-indicator' aria-hidden='true'>
                <svg viewBox='0 0 12 12' fill='none'><path d='M2.5 6L5 8.5L9.5 3.5'/></svg>
              </span>
              <div class='check-content'>
                <span class='check-title lang-zh'>作品 Lab · 慢工出细活</span>
                <span class='check-title lang-en'>Craft Lab</span>
                <span class='check-note lang-zh'>经验互借 · 代表作打磨</span>
                <span class='check-note lang-en'>Small cohorts · patient iteration on signature work</span>
              </div>
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* 字段 4: 正在琢磨的事 */}
        <div class='form-field'>
          <label class='field-label' for='join-idea'>
            <span class='lang-zh'>正在做的事，或者想交流的话题</span>
            <span class='lang-en'>Current projects, questions, or topics you care about</span>
            <span class='field-hint lang-zh'>可留空</span>
            <span class='field-hint lang-en'>Optional</span>
          </label>
          <textarea
            id='join-idea'
            name='idea'
            rows='3'
            placeholder='例如：正在构思一个极简独立工具，想找设计师伙伴交流；或者想练习用英语做一次产品 demo……'
            data-placeholder-zh='例如：正在构思一个极简独立工具，想找设计师伙伴交流；或者想练习用英语做一次产品 demo……'
            data-placeholder-en='e.g., Working on a minimal side tool, looking for design feedback, or wanting to practice a calm demo in English...'
          ></textarea>
        </div>

        {/* 字段 5: 联系方式 */}
        <div class='form-field'>
          <label class='field-label' for='join-contact'>
            <span class='lang-zh'>联系方式</span>
            <span class='lang-en'>Contact Information</span>
            <span class='field-hint lang-zh'>微信或邮箱 · 仅用于活动邀请</span>
            <span class='field-hint lang-en'>WeChat ID or Email · strictly for circle invites</span>
          </label>
          <input
            type='text'
            id='join-contact'
            name='contact'
            placeholder='微信号或 Email'
            data-placeholder-zh='微信号或 Email'
            data-placeholder-en='WeChat ID or Email'
            required
            autocomplete='off'
          />
        </div>

        {/* 提交按钮与状态 */}
        <div class='submit-zone'>
          <button type='submit' class='submit-btn-primary' id='submit-trigger'>
            <span class='lang-zh'>提交预约与交流意向</span>
            <span class='lang-en'>Submit Note & Reserve Seat</span>
            <span class='btn-arrow'>→</span>
          </button>
          <span class='privacy-reassurance lang-zh'>
            承诺不作任何商业营销 · 随时可退订联系
          </span>
          <span class='privacy-reassurance lang-en'>
            Unsubscribe anytime · Zero commercial marketing
          </span>
        </div>

        {/* 成功反馈回执函卡片 */}
        <div id='join-feedback' class='feedback-receipt' style='display: none;'>
          <div class='receipt-card'>
            <div class='receipt-header'>
              <span class='receipt-mark'>✦</span>
              <div>
                <h3 class='receipt-title lang-zh'>意向已真诚记录</h3>
                <h3 class='receipt-title lang-en'>Received with Warmth</h3>
                <span class='receipt-id' id='receipt-id-display'>回执编号: WT-PENDING</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class='receipt-desc lang-zh'>
              感谢你的加入。我们会在下一次 Coffee Chat 或 English Chat 排期确定前，通过微信或邮箱与你一对一确认。
            </p>
            <p class='receipt-desc lang-en'>
              Thank you for reaching out. We will connect with you quietly via your contact info prior to our next circle gathering.
            </p>
            <div class='receipt-summary' id='receipt-summary-box'>
              {/* 动态填充摘要 */}
            </div>
            <div class='receipt-actions'>
              <button type='button' class='btn-copy-receipt' id='btn-copy-receipt'>
                <span class='lang-zh'>复制我的预约摘要</span>
                <span class='lang-en'>Copy Summary</span>
              </button>
              <a href='/' class='btn-back-home'>
                <span class='lang-zh'>返回主页</span>
                <span class='lang-en'>Back Home</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<script>
  function setupJoinPageForm() {
    const form = document.getElementById('circle-join-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
    const feedback = document.getElementById('join-feedback');
    const submitBtn = document.getElementById('submit-trigger');
    const receiptIdDisplay = document.getElementById('receipt-id-display');
    const receiptSummaryBox = document.getElementById('receipt-summary-box');
    const copyBtn = document.getElementById('btn-copy-receipt');

    function syncPlaceholders() {
      const isEn = document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-lang') === 'en';
      document.querySelectorAll<HTMLInputElement | HTMLTextAreaElement>('[data-placeholder-zh]').forEach(el => {
        el.placeholder = isEn ? (el.dataset.placeholderEn || '') : (el.dataset.placeholderZh || '');
      });
    }

    syncPlaceholders();
    window.addEventListener('site-language-change', syncPlaceholders);

    let lastPayloadText = '';

    if (form && feedback) {
      form.onsubmit = async (e) => {
        e.preventDefault();
        
        const formData = new FormData(form);
        const name = formData.get('name') as string;
        const craft = formData.get('craft') as string;
        const interests = formData.getAll('interests') as string[];
        const idea = formData.get('idea') as string;
        const contact = formData.get('contact') as string;
        const clientTimestamp = new Date().toISOString();

        const payload = {
          name,
          craft,
          interests,
          idea,
          contact,
          clientTimestamp,
        };

        // 1. 本地存储备份
        try {
          const existing = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('wotech_rsvp_backup') || '[]');
          existing.push(payload);
          localStorage.setItem('wotech_rsvp_backup', JSON.stringify(existing));
        } catch (err) {}

        // 2. 尝试向服务端 API 提交
        let subId = `WT-${Date.now().toString(36).slice(-5).toUpperCase()}`;
        if (submitBtn) submitBtn.setAttribute('disabled', 'true');

        try {
          const res = await fetch('/api/join', {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
            body: JSON.stringify(payload),
          });
          if (res.ok) {
            const resData = await res.json();
            if (resData.submissionId) {
              subId = resData.submissionId;
            }
          }
        } catch (err) {}

        const isEn = document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-lang') === 'en';

        // 3. 展现回执
        if (receiptIdDisplay) {
          receiptIdDisplay.textContent = isEn ? `Receipt ID: #${subId}` : `回执编号: #${subId}`;
        }

        if (receiptSummaryBox) {
          receiptSummaryBox.innerHTML = `
            <div class="summary-line"><span>${isEn ? 'Moniker:' : '称呼：'}</span><strong>${name}</strong></div>
            <div class="summary-line"><span>${isEn ? 'Craft Domain:' : '领域：'}</span><span>${craft}</span></div>
            <div class="summary-line"><span>${isEn ? 'Gatherings:' : '意向活动：'}</span><span>${interests.join(' / ') || (isEn ? 'None specified' : '未指定')}</span></div>
            <div class="summary-line"><span>${isEn ? 'Contact:' : '联系方式：'}</span><code>${contact}</code></div>
          `;
        }

        lastPayloadText = `wo/men in tech 回执 #${subId}\n称呼: ${name}\n领域: ${craft}\n意向: ${interests.join(', ')}\n联系: ${contact}`;

        feedback.style.display = 'block';
        if (submitBtn) submitBtn.style.display = 'none';
        feedback.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'nearest' });
      };
    }

    if (copyBtn) {
      copyBtn.onclick = () => {
        if (!lastPayloadText) return;
        const isEn = document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-lang') === 'en';
        navigator.clipboard.writeText(lastPayloadText).then(() => {
          copyBtn.textContent = isEn ? '✓ Copied' : '✓ 已复制到剪贴板';
          setTimeout(() => {
            copyBtn.textContent = isEn ? 'Copy Summary' : '复制我的预约摘要';
          }, 2500);
        });
      };
    }
  }

  setupJoinPageForm();
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', setupJoinPageForm);
</script>

<style>
  .page-container {
    padding: var(--spacing-6) 0 var(--spacing-20);
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-12);
  }

  .section-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-3xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-light);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: var(--line-height-tight);
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-4);
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-family-text);
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.85;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .gold-hairline {
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-gold-dust);
    opacity: 0.5;
    margin-top: var(--spacing-6);
  }

  .form-card-container {
    background: var(--color-surface-pure);
    border: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-gold-dust);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: var(--spacing-10);
  }

  .form-field {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-2);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-8);
  }

  .field-label {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .field-hint {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-normal);
  }

  .quiet-form input[type='text'],
  .quiet-form textarea {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--color-surface-card);
    border: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    padding: var(--spacing-3) var(--spacing-4);
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .quiet-form input[type='text']:focus,
  .quiet-form textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    background: var(--color-surface-pure);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-gold-dust);
  }

  /* 前置细金线选项设计 */
  .quiet-check-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-2);
  }

  .quiet-check-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--spacing-3);
    padding: var(--spacing-3) var(--spacing-4);
    border: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border-divider);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    background: var(--color-surface-card);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .quiet-check-row:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-border);
    background: var(--color-surface-pure);
  }

  .quiet-check-row input {
    position: absolute;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .check-indicator {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    margin-top: 3px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    background: var(--color-surface-pure);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .is-radio .check-indicator {
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .quiet-check-row input:checked ~ .check-indicator {
    border-color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    background: var(--color-primary-dark);
  }

  .is-radio input:checked ~ .check-indicator::after {
    content: '';
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-surface-pure);
  }

  .quiet-check-row svg {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    stroke: var(--color-surface-pure);
    stroke-width: 1.8;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .quiet-check-row input:checked ~ .check-indicator svg {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .check-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .check-title {
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .check-note {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  }

  .submit-zone {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .submit-btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-3);
    padding: var(--spacing-3) var(--spacing-6);
    background: var(--color-primary-dark);
    color: var(--color-surface-pure);
    border: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .submit-btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-text-heading);
  }

  .submit-btn-primary .btn-arrow {
    transition: transform var(--transition-fast);
  }

  .submit-btn-primary:hover .btn-arrow {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .privacy-reassurance {
    font-family: var(--font-family-ui);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* 成功回执 */
  .feedback-receipt {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-8);
  }

  .receipt-card {
    background: var(--color-surface-card);
    border: var(--border-width-thin) solid var(--color-border);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--color-gold-dust);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    padding: var(--spacing-6);
  }

  .receipt-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--spacing-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-3);
  }

  .receipt-mark {
    color: var(--color-gold-dust);
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
  }

  .receipt-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    color: var(--color-text-heading);
  }

  .receipt-id {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .receipt-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-family-body);
